==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{term|spedily|lang=enm}}, {{term|spedili|lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|ang|en}} {{m|ang|*spēdiġlīċe}}, {{m|ang|ġespēdiġlīċe||prosperously}}, equivalent to {{suffix|speedy|ly|lang=en}}. Cognate with {{etyl|sco|-}} {{term|spedely|lang=sco}}, {{term|spedelie||quickly, speedily|lang=sco}}. Compare also {{etyl|ang|-}} {{m|ang|spēdlīċe||effectually, effectively, successfully, efficaciously, powerfully, in a manner which produces a result}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈspiːdɪli/|lang=en}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|er|more}}

# In a [[speedy]] or [[fast]] manner.

